4. BSD 3-Clause and BSD-style licenses (each notice ships verbatim, its comment markers removed)
   - OW2 ASM 9.8 (org.ow2.asm), in compiler.wasm twice: bundled by TeaVM renamed to org.teavm.asm (asm,
